  "text": "Extract high-conviction product insights from your user calls in seconds. You finish an hour-long customer interview with five pages of messy notes and no clear action items. Manually synthesizing interviews across multiple team members leads to mismatched priorities and delayed engineering cycles. Feed call transcripts directly into an automated Make pipeline that clusters sentiment and tags features inside Notion. This accelerates feature validation and cuts product discovery overhead.",
